1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

2
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kaki narase sonzai wo</b></font></font></font>

4
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>rock away your existence</b></font></font></font>

5
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>koko ni iru to</b></font></font></font>

6
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>shouting that you are here</b></font></font></font>

7
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>arata na tabi ga ima hajimaru</b></font></font></font>

8
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>a new journey begins now</b></font></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kawari yuku kisetsu no naka wo ikinuku tabi ni bokura</b></font></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>as we survived through the changing seasons</b></font></font></font>

11
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>chie to tsuyosa wo te ni ireta kedo JUST LOOKS LIKE SURVIVAL GAME</b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we gained knowledge and strength (just looks like a survival game)</b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:38,030 --> 00:01:42,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, Grandma Tsunade,
am I really so...?</font>

32
00:01:44,410 --> 00:01:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to think of it,
I've felt dull recently</font>

33
00:01:47,870 --> 00:01:50,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I make more mistakes
with Jutsu than before.</font>

34
00:01:50,790 --> 00:01:52,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And even worse...</font>

35
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:56,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't eat more than five of
the large-size ramen noodles at Ichiraku.</font>

36
00:01:57,300 --> 00:02:00,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Might I perhaps have
some terrible illness?!</font>

37
00:02:00,260 --> 00:02:03,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, tell me.
I'm prepared to hear the worst!</font>

38
00:02:04,100 --> 00:02:05,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are in good health.</font>

39
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! That's Bushy Brow's
medical record, isn't it?</font>

40
00:02:11,110 --> 00:02:13,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Recently he's been avoiding
his regular checkups.</font>

41
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bring him in, will you?</font>

42
00:02:14,610 --> 00:02:16,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? But what about me?</font>

43
00:02:17,650 --> 00:02:19,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are stupid. That's all!</font>

44
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be on your way!</font>

45
00:02:22,330 --> 00:02:24,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Put your clothes back on, you idiot!
— Yes!</font>

46
00:02:24,290 --> 00:02:25,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unbelievable!</font>

47
00:02:26,450 --> 00:02:27,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How was it?</font>

48
00:02:28,540 --> 00:02:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm fit as a fiddle!</font>

49
00:02:31,420 --> 00:02:32,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could tell that just by looking at you.</font>

50
00:02:33,250 --> 00:02:34,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that all about?</font>

51
00:02:34,380 --> 00:02:36,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He doesn't seem to be
in a very good mood, does he?</font>

52
00:02:36,380 --> 00:02:40,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, by the way,
have you seen Bushy Brow?</font>

53
00:02:40,510 --> 00:02:42,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, but I know where he is.</font>

54
00:02:44,180 --> 00:02:46,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These days,
you can always find him here.</font>

55
00:02:48,890 --> 00:02:53,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">2,954, 2,955,</font>

56
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:59,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">2,956, 2,957, 2,958...</font>

57
00:03:00,660 --> 00:03:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's just amazing.</font>

58
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:05,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even after having surgery
for the kind of injury</font>

59
00:03:05,160 --> 00:03:07,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that could prevent him
from continuing on as a Ninja...</font>

60
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:13,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Bushy Brow!
— Lee!</font>

61
00:03:13,130 --> 00:03:14,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brow!</font>

62
00:03:16,090 --> 00:03:17,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee.</font>

63
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:19,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's nothing.</font>

64
00:03:20,380 --> 00:03:24,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade told me
to bring you in for your regular checkup.</font>

65
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:30,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It slipped my mind. I've been
feeling fine lately, so I just...</font>

66
00:03:30,690 --> 00:03:32,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't look like it though.</font>

67
00:03:32,810 --> 00:03:35,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">HIDDEN LEAF HOSPITAL</font>

68
00:03:40,150 --> 00:03:41,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rest for a while.</font>

69
00:03:41,650 --> 00:03:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are forbidden from engaging in
any missions or training.</font>

70
00:03:44,780 --> 00:03:47,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is cumulative damage
to your Chakra Network.</font>

71
00:03:47,950 --> 00:03:49,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were once injured so badly</font>

72
00:03:49,790 --> 00:03:52,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that you had to give up
on being a Ninja for a while.</font>

73
00:03:53,250 --> 00:03:54,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's my self-rule.</font>

74
00:03:58,920 --> 00:04:00,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your self-rule?</font>

75
00:04:00,170 --> 00:04:02,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! To never forget
my original intentions!</font>

76
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:07,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as I keep on trying,
I will be able to continue on as a Ninja!</font>

77
00:04:13,810 --> 00:04:14,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

78
00:04:14,980 --> 00:04:16,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will remove you
from active duty for a while,</font>

79
00:04:16,980 --> 00:04:19,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but you may continue training.
Just don't overdo it.</font>

80
00:04:19,570 --> 00:04:20,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

81
00:04:20,650 --> 00:04:23,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In particular,
I prohibit you to use Hidden Lotus!</font>

82
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:26,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Got that?
— Yes.</font>

83
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:35,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Hey, Bushy Brow, how did it go?</font>

84
00:04:38,090 --> 00:04:40,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong? Hey!</font>

85
00:04:42,670 --> 00:04:44,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The results were bad.</font>

86
00:04:45,050 --> 00:04:46,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Judging from the way he looked,
I'd say considerably.</font>

87
00:04:47,050 --> 00:04:49,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By "considerably"
do you mean that "considerably"?</font>

88
00:04:49,220 --> 00:04:51,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. Considerable, to be sure.</font>

89
00:04:51,970 --> 00:04:54,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Considerable?!</font>

90
00:05:00,190 --> 00:05:01,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you so down about?! Lee!</font>

91
00:05:03,650 --> 00:05:04,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei!</font>

92
00:05:04,740 --> 00:05:08,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard the results of the exam.
You have permission to train, don't you?</font>

93
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:12,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, but the Hidden Lotus...</font>

94
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:17,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That day, you were crying right there.</font>

95
00:05:22,630 --> 00:05:24,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your surgery will be a success</font>

96
00:05:24,260 --> 00:05:26,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because you have worked hard
all the way through.</font>

97
00:05:28,180 --> 00:05:31,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have the power to bring
your own future in the heavens.</font>

98
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:32,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And in the one in a thousand...</font>

99
00:05:32,850 --> 00:05:36,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, one in a million chance
that something goes wrong...</font>

100
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:40,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to die with you!</font>

101
00:05:45,860 --> 00:05:47,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ever since the time I met you,</font>

102
00:05:47,410 --> 00:05:51,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my Way of Ninja has been
bringing you up to be a fine Ninja.</font>

103
00:05:53,790 --> 00:05:54,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promise you!</font>

104
00:05:57,460 --> 00:06:00,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You believed me then and had the surgery.
And it was successful.</font>

105
00:06:00,500 --> 00:06:02,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must have faith in me
one more time!</font>

106
00:06:04,090 --> 00:06:06,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you can no longer use the Hidden Lotus,</font>

107
00:06:06,260 --> 00:06:08,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then strive to attain an even
greater technique through your efforts!</font>

108
00:06:09,300 --> 00:06:11,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are no limits
in the face of your efforts.</font>

109
00:06:11,930 --> 00:06:13,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei!</font>

110
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:19,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are a genius at effort!</font>

111
00:06:23,900 --> 00:06:24,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir!</font>

112
00:06:24,980 --> 00:06:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give you some training
for the first time in quite a spell!</font>

113
00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:29,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, dash to the Academy practice hall!</font>

114
00:06:29,570 --> 00:06:30,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please instruct me!</font>

115
00:06:30,780 --> 00:06:34,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't get there in ten seconds,
it's 500 push-ups!</font>

116
00:06:34,410 --> 00:06:35,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

117
00:06:35,450 --> 00:06:40,080
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Third Super Beast</font>

118
00:06:35,450 --> 00:06:40,080
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Greatest Rival</font>

119
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:44,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was rash of us to think we could
make it in ten seconds, after all.</font>

120
00:06:45,500 --> 00:06:47,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as well!</font>

121
00:06:48,470 --> 00:06:49,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Five hundred.</font>

122
00:06:55,180 --> 00:06:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been a long time
since I smelled this scent.</font>

123
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:23,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is he?</font>

124
00:07:23,290 --> 00:07:26,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's Yagura.
He's been here for a week.</font>

125
00:07:26,130 --> 00:07:30,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An acquaintance asked me to determine
whether he has aptitude as a Ninja.</font>

126
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:32,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His name is Yagura, you say?</font>

127
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:36,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's pretty good, isn't he?</font>

128
00:07:36,220 --> 00:07:38,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, he has the instincts for it.</font>

129
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:43,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He absorbs the things I teach him
like sand absorbs water.</font>

130
00:07:44,810 --> 00:07:46,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're Rock Lee, aren't you?</font>

131
00:07:46,270 --> 00:07:47,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

132
00:07:47,980 --> 00:07:50,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hear that you have superb techniques.</font>

133
00:07:50,190 --> 00:07:52,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei has told me about you.</font>

134
00:07:52,780 --> 00:07:54,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, nothing that great.</font>

135
00:07:55,990 --> 00:07:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be bashful, you.</font>

136
00:07:57,620 --> 00:07:59,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Guy-sensei?
— Yes?</font>

137
00:07:59,540 --> 00:08:02,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would like to receive some instruction
from my senior.</font>

138
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Fine, then. Begin!
— Huh?!</font>

139
00:08:06,250 --> 00:08:07,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei!</font>

140
00:08:07,460 --> 00:08:09,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You came to train anyway.</font>

141
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:13,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, lend a bit of aid
to your junior partner and warm up.</font>

142
00:08:13,300 --> 00:08:14,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

143
00:08:14,390 --> 00:08:18,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a spring chick who has just arrived,
so try not to let him get hurt.</font>

144
00:08:18,180 --> 00:08:19,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

145
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:22,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's Bushy Brow doing in
the Academy practice hall of all places?</font>

146
00:08:23,020 --> 00:08:25,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought
his condition was considerably bad!</font>

147
00:08:25,310 --> 00:08:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, considerably! Considerably!</font>

148
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:35,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm inexperienced,
but please instruct me.</font>

149
00:08:35,870 --> 00:08:39,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, please bear with me, too.</font>

150
00:08:43,580 --> 00:08:46,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, Lee and Yagura, I want you both
to give it all you've got,</font>

151
00:08:46,500 --> 00:08:48,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but to also observe
the greatest courtesy.</font>

152
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:54,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is friendship!
That is youth. Get ready. Fight!</font>

153
00:08:56,300 --> 00:08:58,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— He's fast!
— Let's have you show me...</font>

154
00:08:58,680 --> 00:09:01,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the depth of the Taijutsu
that Might Guy drilled into you!</font>

155
00:09:05,850 --> 00:09:07,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What power!</font>

156
00:09:13,530 --> 00:09:15,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Every single blow is heavy!</font>

157
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I haven't the strength to absorb them!</font>

158
00:09:19,580 --> 00:09:21,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Hurricane!</font>

159
00:09:23,750 --> 00:09:26,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Closing off the escape path above
and strike from a low position.</font>

160
00:09:26,870 --> 00:09:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

161
00:09:31,630 --> 00:09:33,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf Hurricane was defeated!</font>

162
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:39,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop! Hold it right there!</font>

163
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:41,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee! Are you all right?</font>

164
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:45,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pull yourself together, Bushy Brow!</font>

165
00:09:46,350 --> 00:09:48,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that that just happened?</font>

166
00:09:48,980 --> 00:09:50,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Cross Method.</font>

167
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Meeting the opponent's kick</font>

168
00:09:56,650 --> 00:09:58,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and pinning his foot between
the knee and elbow simultaneously,</font>

169
00:09:58,740 --> 00:10:00,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a "bone-crushing, daring technique."</font>

170
00:10:01,450 --> 00:10:04,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where on earth
did you learn that, Yagura?</font>

171
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't intend to do that.</font>

172
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:08,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body just moved
like that involuntarily.</font>

173
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:11,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, Lee. Are you all right?</font>

174
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:17,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If Lee hadn't been wearing his weights,
his ankle would have been crushed.</font>

175
00:10:19,510 --> 00:10:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a splendid move. Well, then,
let's continue with the practice.</font>

176
00:10:23,060 --> 00:10:24,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's stop here for today.</font>

177
00:10:24,770 --> 00:10:26,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take you to the hospital
to have them look at it.</font>

178
00:10:26,890 --> 00:10:28,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I'm completely fine, I tell you.</font>

179
00:10:29,690 --> 00:10:31,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We knew from the health checkup</font>

180
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:33,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that Bushy Brow's injuries were
considerable to begin with, didn't we?</font>

181
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:34,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Considerable!</font>

182
00:10:35,570 --> 00:10:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was considerable?</font>

183
00:10:36,900 --> 00:10:39,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you,
just considerable, right?!</font>

184
00:10:40,410 --> 00:10:43,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Probably considerable...
— Considerable, I tell you!</font>

185
00:10:43,580 --> 00:10:45,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even with the weights on, that speed...</font>

186
00:10:45,700 --> 00:10:47,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was considerable?!</font>

187
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fortunately, there's nothing wrong
with the bone.</font>

188
00:10:57,010 --> 00:10:58,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

189
00:11:04,970 --> 00:11:07,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Um... When can I begin training again?</font>

190
00:11:08,140 --> 00:11:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying?!</font>

191
00:11:09,730 --> 00:11:11,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to need complete rest
for a while.</font>

192
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:15,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's amazing that your Achilles tendon
remained uninjured, you know.</font>

193
00:11:22,110 --> 00:11:24,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said considerable, so...</font>

194
00:11:25,870 --> 00:11:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I misunderstood it to mean
that he was in a considerable condition.</font>

195
00:11:29,620 --> 00:11:30,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

196
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:33,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he came out of the examination room
looking very down,</font>

197
00:11:33,830 --> 00:11:35,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I just assumed...</font>

198
00:11:37,670 --> 00:11:39,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be sure, he seems dispirited.</font>

199
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:42,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was beaten by a trainee
who isn't even enrolled in the Academy.</font>

200
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:45,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A trainee? Lee?</font>

201
00:11:45,260 --> 00:11:48,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, a kid who has been studying Taijutsu
for only one week.</font>

202
00:11:48,810 --> 00:11:50,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case,
he was incredibly skilled, that...</font>

203
00:11:51,060 --> 00:11:53,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's it called...?</font>

204
00:11:53,940 --> 00:11:56,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— The Cross Method!
— Yes, that!</font>

205
00:11:56,070 --> 00:11:58,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a genius to deploy that
at that instant!</font>

206
00:11:58,860 --> 00:12:01,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hope Lee isn't feeling down, though.</font>

207
00:12:01,820 --> 00:12:04,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he were the kind of guy to get
downhearted about a thing like that,</font>

208
00:12:04,070 --> 00:12:06,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee would have quit being
a Shinobi a long time ago.</font>

209
00:12:07,410 --> 00:12:08,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When Lee was in the Academy,</font>

210
00:12:08,870 --> 00:12:10,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he was told that he had neither
the talent for Ninjutsu,</font>

211
00:12:10,540 --> 00:12:12,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">nor any talent for Genjutsu.</font>

212
00:12:14,380 --> 00:12:16,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Had it been me,
I would have given up long ago.</font>

213
00:12:17,710 --> 00:12:21,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Lee got to where he is now
purely through effort and persistence.</font>

214
00:12:21,670 --> 00:12:22,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he can just heal his injuries,</font>

215
00:12:23,050 --> 00:12:26,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he'll soon outstrip anyone
with natural talent alone.</font>

216
00:12:26,260 --> 00:12:28,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— That's true.
— Damn right!</font>

217
00:12:28,310 --> 00:12:29,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

218
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:32,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've heard that if you train too hard,</font>

219
00:12:32,730 --> 00:12:34,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can wreck your body
and become decrepit...</font>

220
00:12:34,980 --> 00:12:37,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say such a thing!
You're talking about Bushy Brow!</font>

221
00:12:38,150 --> 00:12:40,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm only kidding.
Just a slip of the tongue.</font>

222
00:12:40,400 --> 00:12:42,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Don't even say that in jest!
— Decrepit?</font>

223
00:12:42,650 --> 00:12:44,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know, I know.</font>

224
00:12:45,570 --> 00:12:48,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, actually, we are grateful to Lee.</font>

225
00:12:48,990 --> 00:12:50,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Grateful?</font>

226
00:12:50,790 --> 00:12:52,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, grateful.</font>

227
00:12:53,410 --> 00:12:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, today I'm going to teach you
about self-rule.</font>

228
00:12:58,170 --> 00:13:00,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Self...
— Rule, you say?</font>

229
00:13:00,670 --> 00:13:02,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! Yes! Yes!</font>

230
00:13:02,420 --> 00:13:05,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please teach me! Me! Me!</font>

231
00:13:05,090 --> 00:13:06,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, ready?</font>

232
00:13:06,470 --> 00:13:08,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To all things there are principles,</font>

233
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:14,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and to efficiently make use of things
in daily life, human beings have rules.</font>

234
00:13:14,940 --> 00:13:18,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, today I have something good
to give you all.</font>

235
00:13:18,650 --> 00:13:20,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Something...
— Good?</font>

236
00:13:20,940 --> 00:13:22,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This!</font>

237
00:13:24,900 --> 00:13:27,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These tights are the type
that I habitually use!</font>

238
00:13:27,070 --> 00:13:28,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They have outstanding ventilation
and moisture-wicking properties!</font>

239
00:13:29,070 --> 00:13:31,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Developed for ultimate ease of movement,
it's the complete super-athletic wear!</font>

240
00:13:31,700 --> 00:13:34,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you wear them when you're training,
you'll feel the difference immediately!</font>

241
00:13:34,250 --> 00:13:35,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't be able to do without them!</font>

242
00:13:35,500 --> 00:13:37,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next thing you know,
you'll be wearing them all the time!</font>

243
00:13:37,750 --> 00:13:41,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, yes, yes!
Please, by all means, give me a pair!</font>

244
00:13:41,210 --> 00:13:44,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I got a pair of those myself.
They look cool, don't they?</font>

245
00:13:44,670 --> 00:13:46,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, is that so?</font>

246
00:13:48,470 --> 00:13:50,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it weren't for Lee...</font>

247
00:13:52,640 --> 00:13:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is youth!</font>

248
00:13:53,930 --> 00:13:55,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is guts!</font>

249
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:57,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is Harutaro Minami,
spring chicken of the South!</font>

250
00:13:57,730 --> 00:13:59,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You got that all wrong!
— You got that all wrong!</font>

251
00:14:00,770 --> 00:14:03,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm really glad that we've had Lee around.</font>

252
00:14:03,900 --> 00:14:05,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, me too.</font>

253
00:14:07,450 --> 00:14:09,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure a C-rank mission would
feel insufficient for you,</font>

254
00:14:09,950 --> 00:14:12,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but there's nobody left to ask.</font>

255
00:14:12,530 --> 00:14:13,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me.</font>

256
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:18,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, by the way, there's someone
I'd like to take with me...</font>

257
00:14:21,590 --> 00:14:22,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yagura!</font>

258
00:14:24,710 --> 00:14:26,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When my foot heals,
let's train together aga...</font>

259
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:30,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel no need to take lessons from you.</font>

260
00:14:32,300 --> 00:14:34,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even ruling out the fact
that you were wearing weights,</font>

261
00:14:34,770 --> 00:14:37,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there seems
to be nothing worth stealing from you.</font>

262
00:14:38,190 --> 00:14:39,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stealing?</font>

263
00:14:39,560 --> 00:14:42,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, skills acquired
purely through effort</font>

264
00:14:42,610 --> 00:14:46,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">make you nothing
but a pale imitation of Guy-sensei.</font>

265
00:14:46,150 --> 00:14:47,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!</font>

266
00:14:47,400 --> 00:14:51,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As proof of that,
even Sensei has given up on you.</font>

267
00:14:51,570 --> 00:14:53,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That can't be!</font>

268
00:14:53,330 --> 00:14:55,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei promised me...</font>

269
00:14:56,290 --> 00:14:59,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that his own Way of Ninja was
to turn me into a splendid Ninja, too!</font>

270
00:15:01,880 --> 00:15:04,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, then, I wonder why he's gone
so far as to ask me</font>

271
00:15:04,750 --> 00:15:07,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to come on a mission with him
for practical training.</font>

272
00:15:07,460 --> 00:15:09,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not you, but me.</font>

273
00:15:10,220 --> 00:15:11,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You?</font>

274
00:15:12,430 --> 00:15:16,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too bad. There's no way
effort can win out over talent.</font>

275
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:18,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

276
00:15:19,140 --> 00:15:20,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did Sensei really asked you to...?</font>

277
00:15:26,860 --> 00:15:29,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it... can't be true.</font>

278
00:15:41,290 --> 00:15:42,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

279
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

280
00:15:44,540 --> 00:15:46,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yagura has been injured
and is under protection.</font>

281
00:15:46,420 --> 00:15:49,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Guy was with him.
What on earth happened?</font>

282
00:15:49,970 --> 00:15:53,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! Yagura is said to have been attacked
before reaching Hidden Leaf Village.</font>

283
00:15:54,760 --> 00:15:57,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then the trainee Yagura
that accompanied Guy is...</font>

284
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A total imposter.</font>

285
00:16:01,350 --> 00:16:04,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it, one nuisance after another...!</font>

286
00:16:05,770 --> 00:16:08,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, these three are the ones
that can be mobilized?</font>

287
00:16:08,280 --> 00:16:09,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What shall we do?</font>

288
00:16:12,030 --> 00:16:14,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine! Have Neji, Tenten and Naruto...</font>

289
00:16:14,530 --> 00:16:17,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">these three go after Guy
and the phony Yagura!</font>

290
00:16:17,080 --> 00:16:18,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Right!
— Wait!</font>

291
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:22,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have Sakura keep an eye on Lee.</font>

292
00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:24,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he learns about this,</font>

293
00:16:24,170 --> 00:16:26,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's apt to dash out,
even in the shape he's in.</font>

294
00:16:26,290 --> 00:16:27,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

295
00:16:29,090 --> 00:16:32,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you sure that Intense Brow Sensei
went this way?</font>

296
00:16:32,170 --> 00:16:33,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without a doubt!</font>

297
00:16:33,220 --> 00:16:34,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His destination was
the Land of Mountain Streams.</font>

298
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:36,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He must have gone through this forest.</font>

299
00:16:36,390 --> 00:16:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's another way to go,
cutting through the mountains,</font>

300
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:41,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it's too dangerous.</font>

301
00:16:45,350 --> 00:16:46,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yagura, are you with me?</font>

302
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:48,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, Guy-sensei!</font>

303
00:16:49,020 --> 00:16:50,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't slow down!</font>

304
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:53,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take each step after first taking
the measure of the mountain terrain!</font>

305
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:54,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

306
00:16:54,490 --> 00:16:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee could run through here blindfolded.</font>

307
00:16:58,700 --> 00:16:59,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong? Yagura?</font>

308
00:17:00,870 --> 00:17:01,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no!</font>

309
00:17:05,790 --> 00:17:08,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yagura! Where are you?! Yagura!</font>

310
00:17:08,840 --> 00:17:09,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yagura!</font>

311
00:17:10,710 --> 00:17:12,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He may be a genius,
but he's still a trainee.</font>

312
00:17:13,010 --> 00:17:15,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if I expected
too much from him.</font>

313
00:17:16,470 --> 00:17:17,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yagura!</font>

314
00:17:17,930 --> 00:17:19,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Were you in such a place?</font>

315
00:17:27,850 --> 00:17:30,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wooden Training Dummies
for kung fu training.</font>

316
00:17:34,530 --> 00:17:38,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my... It takes me back to my youth.</font>

317
00:17:38,410 --> 00:17:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I trained with a burning spirit on
the same kinds of Wooden Dummies.</font>

318
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:45,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It makes my body start
to move uncontrollably.</font>

319
00:17:48,170 --> 00:17:51,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why are there Wooden Dummies
in such a place?</font>

320
00:17:52,210 --> 00:17:53,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who in the world...?</font>

321
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:57,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And for what purpose?</font>

322
00:18:08,690 --> 00:18:10,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They move well for dummies.</font>

323
00:18:12,610 --> 00:18:15,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, after all, they just look
like automated dolls.</font>

324
00:18:16,070 --> 00:18:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They only have one pattern of movement,</font>

325
00:18:18,410 --> 00:18:20,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and no matter
how many of them there are,</font>

326
00:18:20,570 --> 00:18:24,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">their reach only extends
for a diameter of 3.5 meters,</font>

327
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so they cannot attack.</font>

328
00:18:28,330 --> 00:18:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Mister, you can move?!</font>

329
00:18:35,460 --> 00:18:36,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck?!</font>

330
00:18:42,220 --> 00:18:44,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey? Can't you see anything yet? Neji!</font>

331
00:18:44,470 --> 00:18:47,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even using the Byakugan,
I can't find a single footprint.</font>

332
00:18:48,390 --> 00:18:50,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They can't have gotten that far away,
can they?</font>

333
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:53,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They wouldn't have used excessively
dangerous mountain paths either.</font>

334
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:01,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However they seem to be able to move,</font>

335
00:19:01,490 --> 00:19:03,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they're just stick figures crawling
over the surface of the ground.</font>

336
00:19:04,910 --> 00:19:07,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mister, you can jump, too?!</font>

337
00:19:12,790 --> 00:19:15,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not just yet!</font>

338
00:19:37,570 --> 00:19:39,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a...</font>

339
00:19:43,280 --> 00:19:45,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">pleasant, high-energy training place!</font>

340
00:19:50,410 --> 00:19:58,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">6,985, 6,986, 6,987, 6,988,</font>

341
00:19:58,960 --> 00:20:04,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">6,989, 6,990, 6,991...</font>

342
00:20:04,180 --> 00:20:06,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no limit to training.</font>

343
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:08,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I cannot use my legs,</font>

344
00:20:08,350 --> 00:20:10,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my upper half is still in good shape.</font>

345
00:20:10,310 --> 00:20:11,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei thinks...</font>

346
00:20:11,730 --> 00:20:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my training is inadequate.</font>

347
00:20:13,940 --> 00:20:17,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why he compared me to Yagura,</font>

348
00:20:17,270 --> 00:20:20,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to show me that I wasn't doing enough.</font>

349
00:20:20,900 --> 00:20:22,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">7,000!</font>

350
00:20:24,740 --> 00:20:27,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have faith in Guy-sensei!</font>

351
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:31,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're moderately powerful, but...</font>

352
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">their movements are monotonous.</font>

353
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:36,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or so I thought!</font>

354
00:20:40,340 --> 00:20:44,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall I say I am outnumbered?
There seems to be no limit to them!</font>

355
00:20:47,140 --> 00:20:48,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this sound?</font>

356
00:20:57,520 --> 00:20:58,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

357
00:21:30,780 --> 00:21:33,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">hoshikuzu suchasucha sucha odoru</font></font></b></font></font>

358
00:21:30,780 --> 00:21:33,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">on a checkerboard night</font></font></b></font></font>

359
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:35,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">ichimatsu no yoru ni</font></font></b></font></font>

360
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:35,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">when the stardust's are rapidly dancing</font></font></b></font></font>

361
00:21:35,740 --> 00:21:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">aa mada kaeri takunai to kuchi ni wa dasenai naa</font></font></b></font></font>

362
00:21:35,740 --> 00:21:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">I just can't come out and say, "ah, I don't want to go home yet"</font></font></b></font></font>

363
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">omowa seburi terii</font></font></b></font></font>

364
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">suggestively</font></font></b></font></font>

365
00:21:44,080 --> 00:21:47,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">aisubeki kao ni tsuba wo misutaa kuriketto</font></font></b></font></font>

366
00:21:44,080 --> 00:21:47,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">spat at that beloved face, mister cricket</font></font></b></font></font>

367
00:21:49,800 --> 00:21:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">asekusai suteeji no ue de hikaru toronboon no</font></font></b></font></font>

368
00:21:49,800 --> 00:21:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">the trombone gradually going off-key</font></font></b></font></font>

369
00:21:54,880 --> 00:22:01,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">picchi ga dandan hazureteitteiru no mo kininaru kedo</font></font></b></font></font>

370
00:21:54,880 --> 00:22:01,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">while on the sweaty center stage does bug me</font></font></b></font></font>

371
00:22:01,350 --> 00:22:06,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">sonna koto yori kono nai mune no moyamoya wa sakki</font></font></b></font></font>

372
00:22:01,350 --> 00:22:06,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">but more importantly, the fuzziness I feel in my undeveloped chest,</font></font></b></font></font>

373
00:22:06,150 --> 00:22:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">nonda koora no sei kashira nee</font></font></b></font></font>

374
00:22:06,150 --> 00:22:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">I wonder If it's from that coke I just drank?</font></font></b></font></font>

375
00:22:40,330 --> 00:22:42,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I thought I knew,
but you do have incredible power, after all.</font>

376
00:22:43,300 --> 00:22:45,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">To think you have such
an amazing kick.</font>

377
00:22:45,260 --> 00:22:47,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Looks like I have to put out
everything in myself.</font>

378
00:22:47,420 --> 00:22:50,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Then I would put everything
I've got into this too.</font>

379
00:22:50,760 --> 00:22:53,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Fine! Why don't you come at me
with intent to beat me?!</font>

380
00:22:53,600 --> 00:22:55,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Please forgive me Guy-sensei.</font>

381
00:22:55,100 --> 00:22:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But to me, this is the moment...</font>

382
00:22:57,730 --> 00:23:01,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— to follow through with my own Ninja Way!
— to follow through with my own Ninja Way!</font>

383
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:05,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Clash of Tears! Hot-Blooded Master-Desciple Battle."</font>

